OL,3,GNEWSA'Super offensive' - we love how we
OL,4,Alook but AI tried to 'fix' our visible
OL,5,Adifferences
OL,6,
OL,7,FPeople with scars, birthmarks and
OL,8,Fmedical conditions have told the BBC
OL,9,Fhow AI tools have changed or erased
OL,10,Ftheir personal features.
OL,12,FRhiannon Morgan, from Bridgend, said an
OL,13,Fimage of her used in a work newsletter
OL,14,Fhad been auto-retouched by AI.
OL,16,FA BBC Wales investigation found AI
OL,17,Ftools including Elon Musk's Grok,
OL,18,FGoogle's Gemini and OpenAI's ChatGPT
OL,19,Fremoved visible differences when
OL,20,Fprompted to make a person look
OL,21,F"normal".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
